1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,625
Related cards can turn a busy board
into a clear structure.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:09,350
Hold Shift and select two or more cards.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:17,200
Choose Make booklet for an ordered thread.
Papol stacks it into a vertical reading path.

4
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:24,250
For ideas without a fixed order, select another set
and choose Make collection.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,475
Collections keep a flexible layout. Choose Auto-arrange
for a tidy grid, or Freeform to arrange cards yourself.

6
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:39,775
Booklets are paths. Collections are clusters.
Enjoy Papol.
